{"seq":3,"slug":"spatial-layers","title":"空间层次与纵深构图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/composition-theory/dynamic-composition/spatial-layers","wordCount":2264,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"空间层次与纵深构图\">空间层次与纵深构图</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>摄影是将三维世界压缩为二维平面的艺术——但优秀的构图能让观者&quot;看见&quot;深度。空间层次（Spatial Layers）构图通过前景、中景、远景的分层配置，利用透视、大气、焦点、亮度等多种深度线索（Depth Cues），在平面照片中重建三维空间感。这不仅是技术问题，更是叙事策略：每一层空间都承载着不同的信息角色。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;Spatial Depth&lt;br/&gt;空间纵深&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Monocular Cues&lt;br/&gt;单目深度线索&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;Photographic Controls&lt;br/&gt;摄影控制手段&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;Layer Roles&lt;br/&gt;层次功能&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;Linear Perspective&lt;br/&gt;线性透视&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[&quot;Atmospheric Perspective&lt;br/&gt;大气透视&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[&quot;Occlusion&lt;br/&gt;遮挡&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B4[&quot;Relative Size&lt;br/&gt;相对大小&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;Depth of Field&lt;br/&gt;景深&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[&quot;Focal Length&lt;br/&gt;焦距&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[&quot;Light Gradient&lt;br/&gt;光线梯度&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;Foreground: Context&lt;br/&gt;前景:环境&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[&quot;Middle: Subject&lt;br/&gt;中景:主体&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[&quot;Background: Atmosphere&lt;br/&gt;远景:氛围&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"Spatial Depth&lt;br/&gt;空间纵深\"] --&gt; B[\"Monocular Cues&lt;br/&gt;单目深度线索\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"Photographic Controls&lt;br/&gt;摄影控制手段\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"Layer Roles&lt;br/&gt;层次功能\"]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"Linear Perspective&lt;br/&gt;线性透视\"]\n    B --&gt; B2[\"Atmospheric Perspective&lt;br/&gt;大气透视\"]\n    B --&gt; B3[\"Occlusion&lt;br/&gt;遮挡\"]\n    B --&gt; B4[\"Relative Size&lt;br/&gt;相对大小\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"Depth of Field&lt;br/&gt;景深\"]\n    C --&gt; C2[\"Focal Length&lt;br/&gt;焦距\"]\n    C --&gt; C3[\"Light Gradient&lt;br/&gt;光线梯度\"]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"Foreground: Context&lt;br/&gt;前景:环境\"]\n    D --&gt; D2[\"Middle: Subject&lt;br/&gt;中景:主体\"]\n    D --&gt; D3[\"Background: Atmosphere&lt;br/&gt;远景:氛围\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>空间层次构图用前景、中景、远景的分层配置，借助多种深度线索在二维平面中重建三维空间感——不仅是技术问题，更是叙事策略。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>深度线索</strong>：线性透视、大气透视、遮挡、相对大小——人眼据以判断距离的单目线索</li>\n<li><strong>摄影控制</strong>：景深（清晰度梯度）、焦距（空间压缩/拉伸）、光线梯度——摄影师可主动调节的纵深工具</li>\n<li><strong>层次角色</strong>：前景定&quot;从哪里进入&quot;、中景承载主体、远景提供环境与氛围</li>\n<li><strong>三层经典结构</strong>：前-中-远分别承担入口/主体/氛围，面积占比有经验区间</li>\n<li><strong>层次打破</strong>：刻意破坏层次秩序（大面积遮挡、远景异常清晰、层间跨越）可制造惊喜</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"深度线索系统\">深度线索系统</h2><h3 id=\"线性透视\">线性透视</h3><p>线性透视是最强的深度线索——平行线在远方交汇于消失点（Vanishing Point），这一几何规律被人类视觉系统自动解读为距离。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mtext>apparent</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mtext>real</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mi>f</mi><mi>d</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_{\\text{apparent}} = h_{\\text{real}} \\times \\frac{f}{d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">apparent</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">real</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mtext>apparent</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_{\\text{apparent}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">apparent</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是物体在画面中的表观高度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mtext>real</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_{\\text{real}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">real</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是真实高度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 是焦距，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 是物体距离。距离加倍，表观尺寸减半——这就是深度的几何编码。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>透视类型</th>\n<th>消失点数量</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一点透视</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>强烈纵深隧道感</td>\n<td>笔直道路、走廊</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>两点透视</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>建筑体积感</td>\n<td>街角建筑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三点透视</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>仰视/俯视的高度感</td>\n<td>仰拍摩天大楼</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>鱼眼/曲线透视</td>\n<td>连续</td>\n<td>球面空间包裹感</td>\n<td>超广角/鱼眼镜头</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"大气透视\">大气透视</h3><p>大气中的微粒对不同波长光线的散射造成远处物体的三个变化：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>对比度降低</strong>：远景的明暗差异变小</li>\n<li><strong>饱和度降低</strong>：颜色变淡、偏灰</li>\n<li><strong>色调偏移</strong>：偏蓝/偏紫（短波散射更强）</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mtext>apparent</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mtext>object</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mtext>airlight</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{\\text{apparent}} = I_{\\text{object}} \\times e^{-\\beta d} + I_{\\text{airlight}} \\times (1 - e^{-\\beta d})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">apparent</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">object</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9824em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">airlight</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1491em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这就是计算机视觉中的&quot;去雾模型&quot;——在摄影中，我们不是要消除大气透视，而是<strong>利用它作为深度标记</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>大气条件</th>\n<th>纵深暗示强度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>晨雾</td>\n<td>极强</td>\n<td>层峦叠嶂的山景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>轻霾</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>城市天际线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>清澈空气</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>高原、沙漠（需用其他线索）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>浓雾</td>\n<td>过强（只能看近）</td>\n<td>极简主义构图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>雨幕</td>\n<td>中强</td>\n<td>纵深的街景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"遮挡与相对大小\">遮挡与相对大小</h3><p>遮挡（Occlusion）是最基本的深度判断——A 挡住 B，则 A 比 B 近。这一线索如此基本以至于可以覆盖其他所有线索：即使一个物体画得更小（暗示更远），只要它遮挡了另一物体，它就被感知为更近。</p>\n<p>相对大小（Relative Size）则基于经验：已知大小的物体（如人、汽车、建筑）在画面中变小，即被解读为更远。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"摄影控制手段\">摄影控制手段</h2><h3 id=\"景深-depth-of-field\">景深（Depth of Field）</h3><p>景深是摄影最独特的空间分层工具——它用<strong>清晰度梯度</strong>直接标注距离：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>DOF</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>N</mi><mi>c</mi><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{DOF} \\approx \\frac{2 N c d^2}{f^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DOF</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3715em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 是光圈值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 是容许弥散圆直径，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 是对焦距离，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 是焦距。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>光圈</th>\n<th>景深特征</th>\n<th>空间层次效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>1.4</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f/1.4–f/2.0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">/1.4–</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">/2.0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>极浅景深</td>\n<td>前中远三层清晰度明确分离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2.8</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f/2.8–f/4.0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">/2.8–</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">/4.0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>浅景深</td>\n<td>主体清晰，前后柔化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>5.6</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>8.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f/5.6–f/8.0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">/5.6–</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">/8.0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>中等景深</td>\n<td>前中景清晰，远景略柔</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>11</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f/11–f/16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">/11–</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">/16</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>深景深</td>\n<td>几乎全域清晰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>22</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f/22+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">/22</span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>泛焦</td>\n<td>无景深分层（需用其他线索）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h4 id=\"散景-bokeh-的层次功能\">散景（Bokeh）的层次功能</h4><p>散景不仅是美学元素，更是空间信息的载体：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>前景散景</strong>：近处失焦元素形成的色块/光斑——框架感 + &quot;观者位置&quot;标记</li>\n<li><strong>背景散景</strong>：远处失焦元素——分离主体 + 提供环境氛围</li>\n<li><strong>散景形状变化</strong>：越偏离光轴散景越椭圆（口径蚀）——暗示方向性纵深</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"焦距与空间压缩\">焦距与空间压缩</h3><p>焦距改变的不是真实透视关系，但改变了<strong>空间层之间的视觉间距</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>焦距</th>\n<th>空间效果</th>\n<th>层次关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>14</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>24</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">14–24mm</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">14–24</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">mm</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>空间拉伸</td>\n<td>前中远距离被夸张，纵深感极强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>35</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>50</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">35–50mm</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">35–50</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">mm</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>接近人眼</td>\n<td>自然的距离感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>85</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>135</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">85–135mm</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">85–135</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">mm</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>轻度压缩</td>\n<td>前后层拉近，主体与背景更紧凑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>200</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>400</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">200–400mm</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200–400</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">mm</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>强压缩</td>\n<td>远处物体看起来与近处一样大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>600</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">600mm+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">600</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">mm</span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>极度压缩</td>\n<td>空间层几乎重叠，平面化效果</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>广角镜头的&quot;深度拉伸&quot;效果：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>perceived</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>real</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>standard</mtext></msub><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>actual</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\text{perceived}} = d_{\\text{real}} \\times \\frac{f_{\\text{standard}}}{f_{\\text{actual}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">perceived</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">real</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2519em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">actual</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">standard</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>24</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">24mm</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">mm</span></span></span></span></span> 镜头的空间感约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50mm</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">mm</span></span></span></span></span> 的两倍——相同物理距离在画面中&quot;看起来更远&quot;。</p>\n<h3 id=\"光线梯度\">光线梯度</h3><p>光线从近到远的变化提供强烈的深度信息：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;Bright Foreground&lt;br/&gt;明亮前景&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Medium Midground&lt;br/&gt;中间中景&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;Dark Background&lt;br/&gt;暗淡远景&quot;]&#10;&#10;    D[&quot;Dark Foreground&lt;br/&gt;暗前景&quot;] --&gt; E[&quot;Lit Subject&lt;br/&gt;明亮主体&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;Dark Background&lt;br/&gt;暗远景&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"Bright Foreground&lt;br/&gt;明亮前景\"] --&gt; B[\"Medium Midground&lt;br/&gt;中间中景\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"Dark Background&lt;br/&gt;暗淡远景\"]\n\n    D[\"Dark Foreground&lt;br/&gt;暗前景\"] --&gt; E[\"Lit Subject&lt;br/&gt;明亮主体\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"Dark Background&lt;br/&gt;暗远景\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>光线模式</th>\n<th>层次效果</th>\n<th>情感</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>前亮后暗</td>\n<td>自然纵深递减</td>\n<td>开放、明朗</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前暗后亮</td>\n<td>戏剧性框架</td>\n<td>神秘、向往</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中间亮两端暗</td>\n<td>聚光灯主体分离</td>\n<td>聚焦、强调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>均匀光线</td>\n<td>层次弱化</td>\n<td>平面、图案化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"层次角色分配\">层次角色分配</h2><h3 id=\"前景的功能\">前景的功能</h3><p>前景是离观者最近的层——它决定了&quot;从哪里看&quot;和&quot;以什么方式进入画面&quot;：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>前景类型</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>引导线前景</td>\n<td>引导视线进入画面</td>\n<td>小径起始、栏杆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>框架前景</td>\n<td>约束视野、增加层次</td>\n<td>树枝、门洞、窗框</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尺度前景</td>\n<td>提供大小参照</td>\n<td>人、花、石头</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>虚化前景</td>\n<td>增加纵深、营造氛围</td>\n<td>前景花丛虚化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>叙事前景</td>\n<td>提供故事上下文</td>\n<td>翻开的书、遗留的物品</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"中景的功能\">中景的功能</h3><p>中景通常是主体所在层——画面叙事的核心：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>主体清晰度</strong>：中景在景深范围内应保持最高清晰度</li>\n<li><strong>主体与环境关系</strong>：中景连接前景（context）和远景（mood）</li>\n<li><strong>动作空间</strong>：主体的活动范围定义在中景层</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"远景-背景-的功能\">远景（背景）的功能</h3><p>远景提供<strong>环境信息</strong>和<strong>情绪氛围</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>背景类型</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>技法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>简洁背景</td>\n<td>不干扰主体</td>\n<td>大光圈虚化 / 仰拍天空</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信息背景</td>\n<td>交代环境故事</td>\n<td>深景深 / 标识性建筑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对比背景</td>\n<td>与主体形成反差</td>\n<td>明暗对比 / 色彩互补</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重复背景</td>\n<td>创造图案节奏</td>\n<td>对称建筑 / 重复结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大气背景</td>\n<td>提供距离感和情绪</td>\n<td>利用雾霾/光线梯度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"多层构图实战\">多层构图实战</h2><h3 id=\"三层经典结构\">三层经典结构</h3><p>最被广泛使用的纵深构图是<strong>前-中-远三层配置</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>清晰度</th>\n<th>面积占比</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>前景</td>\n<td>环境线索/引导元素</td>\n<td>清晰或轻虚化</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mtext>–</mtext><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15\\%–30\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15%–30%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中景</td>\n<td>主体</td>\n<td>完全清晰</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mtext>–</mtext><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30\\%–50\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30%–50%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>远景</td>\n<td>环境/氛围</td>\n<td>虚化或大气透视</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mtext>–</mtext><mn>40</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20\\%–40\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20%–40%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"超多层构图-5-层\">超多层构图（5+层）</h3><p>风光摄影中常通过<strong>焦点合成</strong>（Focus Stacking）实现全域清晰的超多层纵深：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>shots</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌈</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>far</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>near</mtext></msub></mrow><msub><mtext>DOF</mtext><mtext>single</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌉</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{shots}} = \\left\\lceil \\frac{d_{\\text{far}} - d_{\\text{near}}}{\\text{DOF}_{\\text{single}}} \\right\\rceil + 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">shots</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4221em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌈</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DOF</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">single</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">far</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">near</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌉</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>每一层都清晰时，深度信息完全依赖透视和大气——要求场景本身具有丰富的纵深线索。</p>\n<h3 id=\"层次打破-制造惊喜\">层次打破——制造惊喜</h3><p>有时刻意打破层次秩序能创造独特效果：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>打破方式</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>前景大面积遮挡</td>\n<td>窥视感</td>\n<td>从缝隙中看场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>远景元素异常清晰</td>\n<td>距离感消除</td>\n<td>长焦压缩+特殊大气</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>层间元素跨越</td>\n<td>动态穿越感</td>\n<td>飞鸟从前景穿过中景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反射镜面</td>\n<td>层次折叠</td>\n<td>水面倒影重复场景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"不同焦段的层次策略\">不同焦段的层次策略</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;Focal Length Choice&lt;br/&gt;焦距选择&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Wide: 14-24mm&lt;br/&gt;广角&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;Standard: 35-50mm&lt;br/&gt;标准&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;Tele: 85-200mm&lt;br/&gt;中长焦&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; E[&quot;Super Tele: 300mm+&lt;br/&gt;超长焦&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;强化前景&lt;br/&gt;夸大近远差异&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;自然分层&lt;br/&gt;平衡各层&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;压缩空间&lt;br/&gt;叠加层次&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[&quot;极度压缩&lt;br/&gt;层次并置&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"Focal Length Choice&lt;br/&gt;焦距选择\"] --&gt; B[\"Wide: 14-24mm&lt;br/&gt;广角\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"Standard: 35-50mm&lt;br/&gt;标准\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"Tele: 85-200mm&lt;br/&gt;中长焦\"]\n    A --&gt; E[\"Super Tele: 300mm+&lt;br/&gt;超长焦\"]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"强化前景&lt;br/&gt;夸大近远差异\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"自然分层&lt;br/&gt;平衡各层\"]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"压缩空间&lt;br/&gt;叠加层次\"]\n    E --&gt; E1[\"极度压缩&lt;br/&gt;层次并置\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>焦段策略</th>\n<th>层次特点</th>\n<th>最佳应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>广角近摄</td>\n<td>前景巨大+远景微小</td>\n<td>风光（前景兴趣点+远景大场景）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标准平视</td>\n<td>各层比例自然</td>\n<td>街拍、纪实（真实空间感）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中长焦选取</td>\n<td>中远景压缩贴合</td>\n<td>人像（主体-背景关系）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超长焦叠加</td>\n<td>多层平面化排列</td>\n<td>建筑并置、人群叠加</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>空间层次构图将二维画面变为三维舞台——每一层承担不同的叙事和视觉角色，通过深度线索的综合运用让观者<strong>走入</strong>画面。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>深度线索</th>\n<th>控制方式</th>\n<th>效果强度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>线性透视</td>\n<td>镜头焦距 + 拍摄角度</td>\n<td>极强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大气透视</td>\n<td>天气/时间选择</td>\n<td>强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>景深分层</td>\n<td>光圈 + 焦距 + 对焦距离</td>\n<td>强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>遮挡关系</td>\n<td>构图前后安排</td>\n<td>中强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>光线梯度</td>\n<td>光源方向/时段</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>相对大小</td>\n<td>已知物体的距离配置</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"空间层次与纵深构图","id":"空间层次与纵深构图"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"深度线索系统","id":"深度线索系统"},{"level":3,"text":"线性透视","id":"线性透视"},{"level":3,"text":"大气透视","id":"大气透视"},{"level":3,"text":"遮挡与相对大小","id":"遮挡与相对大小"},{"level":2,"text":"摄影控制手段","id":"摄影控制手段"},{"level":3,"text":"景深（Depth of Field）","id":"景深-depth-of-field"},{"level":4,"text":"散景（Bokeh）的层次功能","id":"散景-bokeh-的层次功能"},{"level":3,"text":"焦距与空间压缩","id":"焦距与空间压缩"},{"level":3,"text":"光线梯度","id":"光线梯度"},{"level":2,"text":"层次角色分配","id":"层次角色分配"},{"level":3,"text":"前景的功能","id":"前景的功能"},{"level":3,"text":"中景的功能","id":"中景的功能"},{"level":3,"text":"远景（背景）的功能","id":"远景-背景-的功能"},{"level":2,"text":"多层构图实战","id":"多层构图实战"},{"level":3,"text":"三层经典结构","id":"三层经典结构"},{"level":3,"text":"超多层构图（5+层）","id":"超多层构图-5-层"},{"level":3,"text":"层次打破——制造惊喜","id":"层次打破-制造惊喜"},{"level":2,"text":"不同焦段的层次策略","id":"不同焦段的层次策略"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"运动感与动态表现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/composition-theory/dynamic-composition/sense-of-motion"},"next":{"title":"人像构图法则与实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/composition-theory/genre-composition/portrait-composition"}}